00:50:59.390 --> 00:51:01.830
That's as much as there was.
剧本里就写了这么多。

1245
00:51:02.390 --> 00:51:04.110
Another fan question about the dance.
另一个关于舞蹈的粉丝提问。

1246
00:51:04.310 --> 00:51:11.710
Steve Dresser says, how many takes of that superb dance did it take to get Steve's full moves?
史蒂夫·德雷瑟问，为了拍到史蒂夫完整的舞姿，那段精彩绝伦的舞蹈究竟拍了多少条？

1247
00:51:11.910 --> 00:51:13.790
I'm going to say about six, I think.
我猜大概拍了六条吧，我想。

1248
00:51:13.910 --> 00:51:14.090
Yeah.
对。

1249
00:51:14.270 --> 00:51:14.910
What do you think?
你觉得呢？

1250
00:51:15.010 --> 00:51:15.610
What do you remember?
你还记得吗？

1251
00:51:15.890 --> 00:51:17.010
That seems about right.
这差不多是对的。

1252
00:51:17.250 --> 00:51:20.390
I can't remember when he started slapping his legs.
我不记得他是从什么时候开始拍打大腿的了。

1253
00:51:20.390 --> 00:51:21.390
Yeah, that was amazing.
对，那太精彩了。

1254
00:51:21.510 --> 00:51:23.250
If that was early on or later.
不知道那是早期还是晚期。

1255
00:51:23.250 --> 00:51:24.310
And the worm.
还有机械舞。

1256
00:51:24.490 --> 00:51:25.350
I mean, they were different.
我是说，它们风格各异。

1257
00:51:25.490 --> 00:51:29.610
I feel like there were different versions of the dance and then we kind of made the highlight
我觉得这支舞蹈有不同的版本，然后我们差不多把它剪成了精彩

1258
00:51:29.610 --> 00:51:29.930
reel.
集锦。

1259
00:51:30.210 --> 00:51:30.350
Yes.
是的。

1260
00:51:30.750 --> 00:51:30.950
Yeah.
对。

1261
00:51:31.210 --> 00:51:36.230
And on the deleted scenes, you can see even more of the dancing if you want to.
在删减片段里，如果你想看的话，还能看到更多舞蹈内容。

1262
00:51:36.410 --> 00:51:39.510
I remember when Ken finally was like, okay, cut.
我记得肯最后终于说，好吧，停。

1263
00:51:39.830 --> 00:51:42.230
Steve was on the ground doing the last worm.
史蒂夫当时正趴在地上跳最后一段机械舞。

1264
00:51:42.230 --> 00:51:43.030
Yeah, that was the last one.
对，那是最后一个。

1265
00:51:43.050 --> 00:51:43.270
Yeah.
是的。

1266
00:51:43.430 --> 00:51:48.190
And he got up and everyone applauded for him and you guys came over and gave him a hug
然后他站起来，所有人都为他鼓掌，你们几个走过去给了他一个拥抱

1267
00:51:48.190 --> 00:51:50.310
because he had really gone for it.
因为他是真的拼了。

1268
00:51:50.310 --> 00:51:50.610
That was exhausting.
那可真够累人的。

1269
00:51:50.790 --> 00:51:51.690
Yeah, he completely did.
对，他真的是全力以赴。

1270
00:51:51.850 --> 00:51:52.450
That was amazing.
太精彩了。

1271
00:51:52.450 --> 00:51:53.870
Here's a fan question.
这里有一个粉丝提问。

1272
00:51:54.210 --> 00:51:58.450
Was there music playing when Michael danced or was it added later?
迈克尔跳舞时现场放了音乐吗，还是后来配的？

1273
00:51:59.170 --> 00:52:01.490
My memory is that it was added later.
我的记忆是后来加上去的。

1274
00:52:01.770 --> 00:52:08.510
I mean, I feel like what we often did was we would do one take with the music and then
我的意思是，我觉得我们经常做的是，先跟着音乐拍一镜，然后

1275
00:52:08.510 --> 00:52:13.090
somebody would have a little earwig and they would say, do you want to do it with an earwig?
有人会戴着一个隐形耳机，他们会问，你要不要戴着耳机跳？

1276
00:52:13.170 --> 00:52:17.910
And a lot of effort had gone into making a tiny invisible thing that could play the soundtrack
大家花了很多精力做了一个能播放配乐的微型隐形耳机

1277
00:52:17.910 --> 00:52:19.490
and then the actor would go, no, I don't need it.
然后演员就会说，不用，我不需要。

1278
00:52:20.190 --> 00:52:23.570
And then it was due to the next five takes just for memory.
接下来的五条拍摄就全凭记忆了。

1279
00:52:23.730 --> 00:52:25.650
That's how I feel like it probably went down.
我觉得事情大概就是这样发展的。

1280
00:52:25.830 --> 00:52:29.610
I do remember some fun facts about the band on Booze Cruise.
我确实记得一些关于《酒船之旅》里乐队的有趣花絮。

1281
00:52:29.850 --> 00:52:30.150
Yes.
对。

1282
00:52:30.150 --> 00:52:31.750
We had a lot of questions about the band.
我们收到了很多关于这支乐队的问题。

1283
00:52:31.750 --> 00:52:32.870
Yes, exactly.
对，没错。

1284
00:52:33.090 --> 00:52:41.670
Because my friend Bob Thiel Jr., as you were pointing out on your card, who did our theme
因为正如你在卡片上指出的那样，我的朋友小鲍勃·蒂尔创作了我们的主题

1285
00:52:41.670 --> 00:52:43.170
song, was in the band.
曲，他就在乐队里。

1286
00:52:43.170 --> 00:52:50.590
And three out of the four band people were the guys who played our theme song, Hal Cregan
乐队四个人中有三个就是演奏我们主题曲的人，哈尔·克雷根

1287
00:52:50.590 --> 00:52:57.710
and Dylan also, Dylan O'Brien, who's a big songwriter in LA.
还有迪伦，迪伦·奥布莱恩，洛杉矶的一位知名词曲作者。

1288
00:52:57.710 --> 00:53:03.710
And these guys were friends of mine, or Bob was.
这些人都是我的朋友，或者说鲍勃是。

1289
00:53:03.970 --> 00:53:11.150
And the theme song for The Office was written by Jay Ferguson, but he sent over a version
《办公室》的主题曲是杰·弗格森写的，但他发过一个

1290
00:53:11.150 --> 00:53:17.470
of it on Synthesizer, which was a little, it was great.
合成器版本的过来，虽然有点……不过挺棒的。

1291
00:53:17.550 --> 00:53:21.750
It was obviously a great song, loved it, but it didn't sound, didn't have the energy that
显然是一首好歌，大家都很喜欢，但听起来不对劲，没有那种

1292
00:53:21.750 --> 00:53:22.190
you'd want.
你想要的力量感。

1293
00:53:23.310 --> 00:53:29.830
And so Bob had this kind of rockin' band that he put together of his friends, and we went
于是鲍勃召集了他的朋友们组建了一支摇滚乐队，我们去

1294
00:53:29.830 --> 00:53:34.810
and recorded the theme song with all live instruments in a session.
录音室用全真乐器录制了主题曲。

1295
00:53:35.290 --> 00:53:36.650
That is so cool.
太酷了。

1296
00:53:36.750 --> 00:53:37.990
I did not know that.
我还真不知道这件事。

1297
00:53:38.130 --> 00:53:38.290
Yeah.
对。

1298
00:53:38.530 --> 00:53:39.630
That is so cool.
太酷了。

1299
00:53:39.830 --> 00:53:42.850
And then he became, you know, then he called his band The Scrantones.
然后他，你知道的，后来把他的乐队命名为了“斯克兰顿人”。

1300
00:53:43.170 --> 00:53:43.410
Yeah.
对。

1301
00:53:43.490 --> 00:53:48.330
And then he came to Scranton with us and would play at our parties often.
然后他跟着我们去了斯克兰顿，还经常在我们的派对上弹琴。

1302
00:53:48.330 --> 00:53:54.670
And he was in the, I had a fan write in and say that he's also in Phyllis' wedding with
而且他在，我有个粉丝写信来说，他也出现在菲利斯的婚礼上，

1303
00:53:54.670 --> 00:53:55.850
Kevin in Scrantonicity.
和凯文一起在“斯克兰顿之音”乐队里。

1304
00:53:56.010 --> 00:53:57.370
I had a fan as well.
我也有个粉丝提到的。

1305
00:53:57.490 --> 00:54:03.230
Vanessa McLoad said that she noticed that at least one of the band members shows up later
瓦妮莎·麦克劳德说她注意到至少有一个乐队成员后来

1306
00:54:03.230 --> 00:54:05.570
in Scrantonicity at Phyllis' wedding.
出现在菲利斯婚礼上的“斯克兰顿之音”里。

1307
00:54:05.690 --> 00:54:06.450
Yeah, it's Bob.
对，那是鲍勃。

1308
00:54:06.870 --> 00:54:07.270
Oh.
哦。

1309
00:54:07.430 --> 00:54:12.750
Well, Bob, you know, Bob also did music, the music for Sons of Anarchy and the Mayans.
嗯，鲍勃，你知道的，鲍勃还做过音乐，《混乱之子》和《玛雅帮》的音乐都是他做的。

1310
00:54:12.990 --> 00:54:14.370
So he's quite talented.
所以他很有才华。

1311
00:54:14.570 --> 00:54:15.130
He's so talented.
他太有才了。

1312
00:54:15.230 --> 00:54:15.350
Yeah.
对。

1313
00:54:15.390 --> 00:54:17.570
I have it 11 minutes, 14 seconds.
时间我记在11分14秒。

1314
00:54:17.570 --> 00:54:20.690
This is really crazy if you know these three people.
如果你认识这三个人，这就真的很疯狂。

1315
00:54:21.070 --> 00:54:24.270
Phyllis, Kevin, and Angela are dancing together.
菲利斯、凯文和安吉拉在跳舞。

1316
00:54:24.970 --> 00:54:25.450
Oh.
哦。

1317
00:54:25.690 --> 00:54:25.950
What?
什么？

1318
00:54:26.870 --> 00:54:27.570
I'm telling you.
我跟你说。

1319
00:54:27.590 --> 00:54:31.610
Isn't there a shot of Phyllis dancing with Creed at one point?
是不是有个镜头是菲利斯在某个时候和克里德跳舞？

1320
00:54:31.650 --> 00:54:31.970
Yes.
是的。

1321
00:54:31.970 --> 00:54:32.310
Yes.
对。

1322
00:54:32.310 --> 00:54:34.130
Towards the end, there is.
快到结尾的时候，有的。

1323
00:54:34.250 --> 00:54:35.030
They're dancing together.
他们在一起跳舞。

1324
00:54:35.190 --> 00:54:40.630
But we're doing that awkward dance where like, I almost feel like in eighth grade, we're
但我们跳的是那种尴尬的舞，就像，我甚至觉得像八年级时，

1325
00:54:40.630 --> 00:54:42.130
like a group of girls dance together.
我们就像一群女孩聚在一起跳舞。

1326
00:54:42.450 --> 00:54:44.290
Except it's me, Phyllis, and Kevin.
只不过换成了我和菲利斯还有凯文。

1327
00:54:44.890 --> 00:54:47.410
And we're just kind of doing like a little sway like that.
然后我们就在那儿像这样稍微摇摆着。

1328
00:54:47.530 --> 00:54:48.610
It's just very funny to me.
这对我来说真的很好笑。

1329
00:54:48.950 --> 00:54:51.650
Well, I don't know if you remember, Greg, but there was a runner.
嗯，我不知道你记不记得，格雷格，但有个贯穿情节。

1330
00:54:51.830 --> 00:54:54.830
I read it in the script and then I went back and I saw it in the deleted scenes.
我在剧本里读到了，然后我回去在删减片段里看到了。

1331
00:54:55.190 --> 00:55:00.010
There was this whole runner through this episode that Oscar is a really mean drunk.
这集里有一个贯穿始终的设定，就是奥斯卡喝醉了以后特别刻薄。

1332
00:55:00.510 --> 00:55:00.870
Yes.
对。

1333
00:55:00.870 --> 00:55:02.090
So I'm glad we cut that.
所以我很高兴我们把那段剪掉了。

1334
00:55:02.370 --> 00:55:02.770
Yeah.
是啊。

1335
00:55:02.930 --> 00:55:03.670
I didn't like that.
我也不喜欢那样。

1336
00:55:03.810 --> 00:55:05.950
I reread the script too and I was like, ooh.
我也重读了剧本，当时觉得，噢。

1337
00:55:06.290 --> 00:55:07.730
Glad we didn't use this.
庆幸我们没用这个。

1338
00:55:08.110 --> 00:55:12.150
Where he's just, he's getting drunk and then he's going around and he's insulting all of
就是他喝醉了，然后到处走，

1339
00:55:12.150 --> 00:55:12.330
you.
侮辱你们所有人。

1340
00:55:12.470 --> 00:55:15.330
So that is probably why Oscar is not dancing with you guys.
所以这大概就是奥斯卡没有跟你们一起跳舞的原因。

1341
00:55:15.510 --> 00:55:16.570
And also later.
而且后来也是。

1342
00:55:16.830 --> 00:55:17.870
He's isolated himself.
他把自己孤立起来了。

1343
00:55:18.070 --> 00:55:18.250
Yeah.
对。

1344
00:55:18.390 --> 00:55:20.110
Later, it's just Kevin and I in the booth.
后来，卡座里只剩下我和凯文。

1345
00:55:20.290 --> 00:55:20.390
Yeah.
对。

1346
00:55:20.390 --> 00:55:21.170
And that's probably why.
这大概就是原因。

1347
00:55:21.350 --> 00:55:23.850
Because Oscar's off like talking about you.
因为奥斯卡跑去说你们的坏话了。

1348
00:55:24.090 --> 00:55:24.670
Oh, I forgot about that.
哦，我都把这事给忘了。

1349
00:55:24.670 --> 00:55:29.970
Well, I want to go back to the scene with Jim, Katie, Pam, and Roy sitting around the
嗯，我想回到吉姆、凯蒂、帕姆和罗伊围坐在桌子旁的那个场景。

1350
00:55:29.970 --> 00:55:30.370
table.
桌子旁。

1351
00:55:30.790 --> 00:55:31.010
Great.
太棒了。

1352
00:55:31.910 --> 00:55:36.530
Katie makes a comment where she says, ah, we're at the cool table.
凯蒂发表了一番评论，她说，啊，我们坐在酷小孩那一桌。

1353
00:55:37.030 --> 00:55:40.890
And then they all talk about what they were like in high school, except Jim.
然后他们都在谈论自己高中时是什么样的，除了吉姆。

1354
00:55:41.250 --> 00:55:48.130
We don't hear about Jim, but we find out that Katie was a cheerleader and that Pam was artsy
我们没听到吉姆说，但我们发现凯蒂曾是个拉拉队长，而帕姆则很有艺术

1355
00:55:48.130 --> 00:55:48.650
fartsy.
气息。

1356
00:55:48.870 --> 00:55:49.410
Thanks, Roy.
谢谢你，罗伊。

1357
00:55:49.690 --> 00:55:51.670
And that Roy played sports.
罗伊则搞过体育。

1358
00:55:52.370 --> 00:55:55.370
And then Amy does her little cheer.
然后艾米就来了个小型加油呐喊。

1359
00:55:55.630 --> 00:55:57.690
Amy as Katie does her awesome cheer.
艾米饰演的凯蒂来了个超赞的加油呐喊。

1360
00:55:57.850 --> 00:55:59.110
And that was not in the script.
这可不在剧本里。

1361
00:55:59.490 --> 00:56:04.510
We found out on the set that Amy Adams was a cheerleader and she knew a bunch of cheers
我们在片场发现艾米·亚当斯以前是个拉拉队长，她会很多加油呐喊的动作

1362
00:56:04.510 --> 00:56:09.270
and she did, you had her do little cheers for us to react to.
然后她做了，你让她给我们做了一些加油动作好让我们做出反应。

1363
00:56:09.490 --> 00:56:11.450
Amy and I did a few cheers together.
我和艾米一起做了一些加油动作。

1364
00:56:11.830 --> 00:56:13.790
We were all really punchy, you guys.
大家伙，我们当时都兴奋过头了。

1365
00:56:13.910 --> 00:56:15.890
It was like three in the morning, you know?
当时大概凌晨三点，你知道吧？

1366
00:56:16.010 --> 00:56:16.570
So do you remember?
所以你们还记得吗？

1367
00:56:16.670 --> 00:56:21.130
Because I remember when we were doing that scene and Amy started to do the cheerleader
因为我记得当我们拍那场戏时，艾米开始表演拉拉队长的

1368
00:56:21.130 --> 00:56:26.970
stuff, we did a couple of takes of it and then Ken wanted to move on and something was
东西，我们拍了好几条，然后肯想接着往下拍，但有什么事情

1369
00:56:26.970 --> 00:56:30.390
bothering me and I didn't want to move on from that scene.
困扰着我，我不想就这么跳过那场戏。

1370
00:56:30.650 --> 00:56:35.910
And I realized that the balance, she kind of shifted the balance because Amy Adams is
我意识到平衡，她有点打破了平衡，因为艾米·亚当斯

1371
00:56:35.910 --> 00:56:36.910
obviously very charismatic.
显然非常有魅力。

1372
00:56:37.210 --> 00:56:37.450
Yeah.
对。

1373
00:56:37.610 --> 00:56:38.470
You know, beautiful actress.
你知道，是个美丽的演员。

1374
00:56:38.470 --> 00:56:44.130
And she did that really fun, cute cheerleader thing.
她做了那个非常有趣、可爱的拉拉队长动作。

1375
00:56:44.310 --> 00:56:45.250
And then we were going to move on.
然后我们就要继续往下拍了。

1376
00:56:45.350 --> 00:56:52.710
And I realized like, Pam is just basically not participating on the same level here.
我意识到，帕姆基本上没在同一个层面上参与进来。

1377
00:56:52.870 --> 00:56:59.230
She's kind of denying the cheerleader thing, but she isn't doing her own charismatic thing.
她有点在排斥那个拉拉队动作，但她又没有拿出她自己有魅力的那一面。

1378
00:56:59.350 --> 00:57:04.550
And we went back and at 9.09, I went back to you and I said, you got to kick this up a notch.
我们回过头去，在9分09秒的时候，我去找你，对你说，你得把这劲头提升一个档次。

1379
00:57:04.670 --> 00:57:04.990
Do something.
做点什么。

1380
00:57:05.270 --> 00:57:05.990
Do you remember that?
你还记得吗？

1381
00:57:05.990 --> 00:57:09.210
And then you kind of mocked her cheerleader thing and you did that.
然后你有点嘲弄了她的拉拉队动作，你做了那个。

1382
00:57:09.430 --> 00:57:10.530
And I was like, yeah.
当时我就想，对。

1383
00:57:10.790 --> 00:57:11.070
Yeah.
对。

1384
00:57:11.130 --> 00:57:12.330
Because that was not in the script.
因为那不在剧本里。

1385
00:57:12.610 --> 00:57:12.890
That wasn't.
本来就没有。

1386
00:57:12.910 --> 00:57:14.930
That was added in the moment.
那是当时临时加上去的。

1387
00:57:15.150 --> 00:57:15.350
Yeah.
对。

1388
00:57:15.410 --> 00:57:19.610
And that's, yeah, I kind of flirt with Jim there.
而且那是，对，我在那里跟吉姆调情了。

1389
00:57:19.610 --> 00:57:19.850
Yeah.
对。

1390
00:57:19.850 --> 00:57:21.650
We have a private moment at the table.
我们在桌旁有一个私密时刻。

1391
00:57:21.670 --> 00:57:25.570
I thought that was like so bold with Roy sitting next to you.
我觉得这太大胆了，罗伊当时就坐在你旁边。

1392
00:57:25.710 --> 00:57:32.010
Like when I watched it again, I was like, wait, she's flirting with Jim, with Roy next
就像我再次看的时候，我想，等等，她居然当着坐在她身边的罗伊的面

1393
00:57:32.010 --> 00:57:34.810
to her and also kind of making fun of Katie.
跟吉姆调情，而且还顺便有点嘲笑凯蒂。

1394
